AI-Based Smart Energy Management System Using ESP32 + Full Stack Development

📌 Project Overview

The AI-Based Smart Energy Management System is an IoT and AI-powered system designed to monitor, analyze, and manage electrical energy consumption efficiently.

The system uses an ESP32 to collect real-time data from electrical sensors and sends the data to a full-stack web application. AI techniques are used to analyze energy usage, detect abnormal consumption, and provide recommendations for reducing energy wastage.

🎯 Objectives

- Monitor electricity consumption in real time.
- Collect energy data using ESP32 and sensors.
- Display energy usage through a web dashboard.
- Detect abnormal or excessive power consumption.
- Use AI to predict energy consumption.
- Provide smart energy-saving recommendations.
- Help users reduce unnecessary electricity usage.

✨ Key Features

🔌 IoT Monitoring

- ESP32-based energy monitoring.
- Real-time sensor data collection.
- Wi-Fi connectivity.
- Voltage, current, power, and energy monitoring.

🤖 AI Features

- Energy consumption prediction.
- Abnormal usage detection.
- Usage pattern analysis.
- Smart energy-saving recommendations.

🌐 Full Stack Web Application

- User-friendly dashboard.
- Real-time energy monitoring.
