🔄 Working Process

1. Sensors measure electrical parameters.
2. ESP32 reads the sensor values.
3. ESP32 processes the readings and connects to Wi-Fi.
4. The data is sent to the backend using an API.
5. The backend stores the data in MongoDB.
6. AI analyzes historical and real-time consumption data.
7. The AI model predicts future energy consumption.
8. The dashboard displays energy information using charts and statistics.
9. The system provides energy-saving recommendations.
10. Optional relays can automatically control appliances.

