🚀 Installation

1. Clone the Repository

git clone https://github.com/yourusername/AI-Smart-Energy-Management.git
cd AI-Smart-Energy-Management

2. Install Backend

cd backend
npm install
npm start

3. Install Frontend

cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev

4. Install AI Dependencies

cd ai-model
pip install -r requirements.txt

5. Configure ESP32

Open the ESP32 Arduino code and configure:

const char* WIFI_SSID = "YOUR_WIFI";
const char* WIFI_PASSWORD = "YOUR_PASSWORD";
const char* SERVER_URL = "YOUR_API_URL";

Upload the program to the ESP32 using Arduino IDE.

